    {
      "ply": 13,
      "san": "Qg4",
      "human_san": "Qg4",
      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "Theory advices 7.Bxe7.\nLilienthal, with the move in the text, preferres a poisoned continuation.\nAfterward Paul Keres stopped any discussion on the subject with his\ndeclaration: \"After 7.Qg4 White is better.\" Full stop. Now Black must do his\nsteps very carefully.",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "",
      "system_symbol": null,
      "is_key_moment": false,
      "final_comment": false,
      "both_present": false,
      "human_only": true,
      "system_only": false,
      "neither": false
    },
    {
      "ply": 14,
      "san": "f5",
      "human_san": "f5",
      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "Lilienthal: \"Afterward, during the Second\nInternational Tournament in Moscow, Vera Menchik, in the same position, played\nagainst me 7... Nc6 but after 8. Bxe7 Kxe7 9. Qg5+ Kf8 10. Qxd8+ Nxd8 11. f4 I\nhad advantage.\"  Preferable to Spielmann's move is however 7... Kf8 with the\npossible continuation 8. Nf3 Nc6 9. Qf4 cxd4 10. Nb5 a6 11. Nbxd4 Nc5",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "",
      "system_symbol": null,
      "is_key_moment": false,
      "final_comment": false,
      "both_present": false,
      "human_only": true,
      "system_only": false,
      "neither": false
    },
    {
      "ply": 15,
      "san": "Qh5+",
      "human_san": "Qh5+",
      "san_match": true,
      "human_comment": "",
      "human_symbol": null,
      "system_comment": "The most accurate move, holding the balance (+0.20, Stockfish:16) after [pv:Qh5+ Kf8 Nb5 cxd4 f4]. The check immediately leaves Black's back rank vulnerable\u2014a weakness that often invites lasting tactical pressure\u2014and the continuation may leave Black with a hanging piece. Qf4 is a comparable option that leads to equality via [pv:Qf4 cxd4 Bxe7 Qxe7 Nb5], where Black could lose the advantage of the bishop pair, but Qh5+ is stronger for its immediate back-rank pressure.",
      "system_symbol": "!",
      "is_key_moment": true,
      "final_comment": true,
      "both_present": false,
      "human_only": false,
      "system_only": true,
      "neither": false
    },
